        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-06T04:07:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>3,079, if you have no duplicates of anything.</p><p>Add 67 if you have both the individually released variants and the Complete Hero Variant Collection.</p><p>Add 110 if you have the Foil Hero Collection.</p><p>Add one if you have Foil Kvothe.</p><p>The total is 3,257 -- off by seven from the BGG list linked above. My guess is that the BGG post didn't include the turn order and battle zone cards in OblivAeon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, add one if you have Cleverest Legacy!</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:28.426Z",
